    ],
    "text": "BY virtue of the powers vested in me by Section 27(1) of the Universities Act, No. 16 of 1978, I, Lakshman Kiriella,Minister of Higher Education and Highways, do by this Order, on the recommendation of the University Grants Commission,amend the Schedule to the Order establishing the University of Sri Jayewardenepura, Sri Lanka, which is deemed, byvirtue of the provisions of Section 139 of the aforesaid Act, to be an Order made under Section 21 of the aforesaid Act,(as last amended by Order published in Gazette Extraordinary, No. 1948/59 of January 08, 2016) by addition immediatelyafter item 10 appearing in Column II under the heading \u201cDepartments\u201d as corresponds to the item \u201c Faculty of Humanitiesand Social Sciences\u201d appearing in Column I under the heading \u201cFaculty\u201d of the Schedule to such deemed Order of thefollowing new item :",
